      "notion_page_uuid": null,
      "org_name": null,
      "org_uuid": null,
      "preview": "The fit gives approximately y = 1.014 x² + 0.06 x + 1.07. R² ≈ 0.9997. The residuals suggest the underlying process is very close to pure quadratic with small measurement noise.",
